<title>UK: Paribas leads $100 million Morocco-linked bond.</title>
<headline>Paribas leads $100 million Morocco-linked bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced</p>
<p>by lead manager Paribas Capital Markets.</p>
<p> BORROWER   MOROCCO INVESTMENTS LTD</p>
<p>BACKED BY MOROCCO TRANCHE A LOANS</p>
<p> AMT    $100 MLN	COUPON     10.0	MATURITY  * 15.OCT.01</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.25    PAY DATE    15.OCT.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  2.00	REOFFER    100.0     SPREAD	+340 BP</p>
<p> NOTES    * CALL AT PAR AFTER THREE YEARS</p>
<p> MOODY	=	   LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    SEMI-ANN</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  =	   DENOMS (K) ONE	 SALE LIMITS US/UK/CAY</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  =	   TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    1.00	SELL CONC  1.00	PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
